### Caching Layer (Exact + Semantic)

#### [MODIFY] [cache_service.py](file:///c:/Users/santosh/OneDrive/Desktop/Fastapi/projects/pdf-chatbot-gemini/backend/cache_service.py)
- Add **Semantic Caching**:
  - `get_semantic_cached_answer(document_id, query_embedding, threshold)`: Computes cosine similarity with cached question vectors for this document. If similarity >= threshold, returns the cached answer + matched question + score.
  - `set_semantic_cached_answer(document_id, question, query_embedding, answer)`: Stores the question text, its embedding vector, and answer payload.
  - Multi-tier retrieval flow: Tier 1 (Exact SHA-256 match, <1ms) -> Tier 2 (Semantic cosine similarity match, <15ms) -> LLM RAG.
  - Support both Redis storage for vector payloads and in-memory fallback.

